<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, keep us burning;</l><l>Make us Your counterpart.</l><l>Lord, saturate us;</l><l>Fill every part with Your life divine.</l><l>Lord, we now surrender all to You.</l><l>Keep us turning to You every day,</l><l>Until we’re expressing only You, always;</l><l>Until we’re expressing only You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
